+# Tasks
+
+## Task 1: Privacy-safe state and payload core
+
+- Add local consent, allowlisted capture, fingerprint deduplication, draft deletion,
+  global disable, anonymous IDs, exact payload construction, and native send-once
+  transport.
+- Prove pending/disabled behavior, allowlist rejection, payload field exclusion,
+  deduplication, decline, disable, and receipt handling with focused tests.
+
+## Task 2: CLI feedback flow
+
+- Add `forge feedback` preview/status/disable handling and the interactive choices:
+  send once, send and enable, or decline.
+- Prove non-interactive invocation does not prompt or send and interactive sends use
+  the exact previewed payload.
+
+## Task 3: Capture integration and manifest
+
+- Capture only explicitly classified Forge-owned internal command failures at the
+  top-level registry error boundary without replacing the original error.
+- Regenerate the command manifest and run focused lint/type/tests.
